1
00:00:00,074 --> 00:00:01,921
Hidup bareng T. rex...

2
00:00:01,921 --> 00:00:03,915
dinosaurus ini malah doyan buah!

3
00:00:03,915 --> 00:00:06,242
Namanya Infernogallus...

4
00:00:06,242 --> 00:00:06,971
artinya,

5
00:00:06,971 --> 00:00:08,227
ayam neraka.

6
00:00:08,227 --> 00:00:11,404
Dia dinosaurus pemakan buah
pertama yang diketahui,

7
00:00:11,404 --> 00:00:12,604
seukuran kalkun.

8
00:00:12,604 --> 00:00:14,986
Rahangnya bisa bergeser maju-mundur,

9
00:00:14,986 --> 00:00:16,611
untuk melumat buah berbiji,

10
00:00:16,611 --> 00:00:18,144
mungkin seperti persik.

11
00:00:18,144 --> 00:00:20,619
Otot rahangnya mirip nuri pemakan buah,

12
00:00:20,619 --> 00:00:22,622
seperti nuri kabare dari Papua.

13
00:00:22,622 --> 00:00:23,869
Dan juga...

14
00:00:23,869 --> 00:00:24,875
manusia.

15
00:00:24,875 --> 00:00:26,316
Dia mengunyah mirip kita.

16
00:00:26,316 --> 00:00:27,636
Ayam neraka: seram,

17
00:00:27,636 --> 00:00:28,449
atau lucu?

18
00:00:28,449 --> 00:00:29,983
Tulis di komentar!
